<!--
  ABYSS_SHEET_DONOR_PORT_1. The giant fibre stalk: owned port of Alpha Biomes' giant septimum (sarg.alphabiomes
  AB_GiantSeptimum, 1.6/Defs/ThingDefs_Plants/Plants_ForsakenCrags.xml); plain name and description are the
  owner's (sheet 2026-10-05; sitting 2 "Looks good."). Every plant/stat field is the donor's own EXCEPT:
    - SIZE x2 (owner's sheet): visualSizeRange 1.3~2.5 -> 2.6~5.0
  ART (owner's "wire as picked"): abyss_elderskeddra_v1, finished in the artpipe, installed 2026-10-06 via the art ledger as
